## Model card

- **Name:** MAI-Code-1.1-Flash
- **Short description:** Microsoft’s MAI-Code-1.1-Flash is described as an agentic coding MoE model (138B total/5B active, 256K context, image input) oriented toward Copilot workflows.
- **Provider / access:** Microsoft/GitHub Copilot contexts per local metadata (`microsoft/mai-code-1.1-flash`, `noFreeId`).
- **Release / knowledge:** Official model card referenced as PDF; knowledge cutoff not established from accessible sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `MAI-Code-1.1-Flash`, `microsoft/mai-code-1.1-flash`.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens total; 128,000 max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.20/$1.20 per 1M in/out via GitHub Copilot contexts; cached input $0.02 (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** MoE (138B total / 5B active) per local metadata; details not independently verified from accessible text sources.

